-- packs of five collectible cards: iconic items, NPCs and places from the world. Every card can
-- come as a common, a rare, a holo or a full-art print. Nothing here is announced; /wp arcade
-- opens it. Coins and cards are saved for the whole account (WaypathDB.arcade).
-- The card list is ArcadeCards.lua (generated by tools/arcade/gen.py).
